Package: firesafety
Title: A collection of security related plugins for fiery
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Thomas Lin", "Pedersen", , "thomasp85@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5147-4711"))
Description: Security is hard and tedious. In order to ease the pain of building
    secure 'fiery' webservers this package provide a range of plugins that
    handle different aspects of security. Be aware that security cannot be
    handled blindly, and even though the plugins here will raise the security of
    your server you should not build critical infrastructure without the aid of
    a security expert.
